Oct 29 19:53:00 raspberrypi ollama[1559]: time=2026-10-29T19:53:00.957+07:00 level=WARN source=llama_server.go:1342 msg="client connection closed before llama-server finished loading, aborting load"
Oct 29 19:53:00 raspberrypi ollama[1559]: time=2026-10-29T19:53:00.957+07:00 level=INFO source=sched.go:692 msg="Load failed" model=/usr/share/ollama/.ollama/models/blobs/sha256-c5396e06af294bd101b30dce59131a76d2b773e76950acc870eda801d3ab0515 error="timed out waiting for llama-server to start: context canceled"

Technical Audit Finding:
1. HTTP Status 499 (Client Closed Request) was recorded by Ollama GIN router.
2. Ollama Go scheduler immediately detected socket disconnection: msg="client connection closed before llama-server finished loading, aborting load".
3. The server aborted loading and canceled context without hanging or leaking worker threads.
4. However, test_suite_a.py (TO_06) itself ONLY caught client-side ReadTimeout; it did not query journalctl programmatically. The server cancellation is confirmed by this systemd journal audit, not by test_suite_a.py code.

