SUMMARY CONCLUSION:
1. Server-side task cancellation IS EMPIRICALLY VERIFIED on this Raspberry Pi 4 host via journalctl.
2. When the client disconnects or times out, Ollama llama-server releases the active slot (`slot release`, `truncated = 1` or `0`), resets state to idle (`srv update_slots: all slots are idle`), and stops burning CPU cycles.
3. However, test_suite_a.py (TO_06) alone did NOT verify this log internally; it is verified through this engineering audit log.
